A delimiter that is part of a larger character is text

```
*️⃣abc*
.
<p>*️⃣abc*</p>
```

```
*a*️⃣
.
<p>*a*️⃣</p>
```

```
*a*́ b*
.
<p><strong>a*́ b</strong></p>
```

```
_︎x _y_
.
<p>_︎x <u>y</u></p>
```

```
~a~‍b~
.
<p><s>a~‍b</s></p>
```

```
*x* *️⃣ *y*
.
<p><strong>x</strong> *️⃣ <strong>y</strong></p>
```

```
{*️⃣abc*}
.
<p>{*️⃣abc*}</p>
```

```
/*️a*/
.
<p><em>*️a*</em></p>
```

```
*ाx *y*
.
<p>*ाx <strong>y</strong></p>
```

```
{^⃣x^}
.
<p>{^⃣x^}</p>
```

```
{,︎x,}
.
<p>{,︎x,}</p>
```
